<title>AUSTRALIA: Golf-Australian PGA leaderboard.</title>
<headline>Golf-Australian PGA leaderboard.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clubhouse leaders during the first round of the Australian PGA golf tournament at the par-72 New South Wales Golf Club on Thursday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>66 Wayne Riley, Bryan Roach</p>
<p>68 Robin Byrd (U.S.), Chris Gray, Grant Waite (New Zealand), Ben Jackson (U.K.)</p>
<p>69 Darren Clarke (U.K.)</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
